I joined Rohit for his weekly Bridgewater Sahaja Yoga Program.

The people there were super nice! Amazing time!

During the general clean up - Aunty Lis found an old kurta of mine! (I graduated 5 years ago!). I actually never whore that kurta [is this a sign that I should go volunteer?]

The rest of the day was spent painting walls & cleaning Rohits car for the road trip!

